        "Phambi kokuba uqokelele amanzi, funda ukuba asele eya phi na. Khangela ukusuka kwindawo ekhuselekileyo ngexesha lemvula enkulu. Xa kukhuselekile emva koko, hamba emhlabeni wakho. Khangela ii-rill (imisele emincinci yamanzi), iindawo apho amanzi asasazeka khona, apho eqokelelana khona, nalapho ephuma khona emhlabeni wakho. Amanzi athile agqithisileyo adinga indlela ekhuselekileyo yokuhamba kude ukuze angabangeli monakalo.\n\nI-A-frame level (isixhobo esimile ngonobumba A esinceda ukufumana iindawo ezilingana ngokuphakama) inokukunceda uphawule amanqaku akwisithuba esinye sokuphakama kwaye ulandele umgca wokuphakama. Iimpawu zayo kukuqwalasela kuphela, asiso isicwangciso okanye imvume yemisebenzi yokumba umhlaba. Phambi kokumba i-swale (umsele wokubamba amanzi ecaleni komgca wokuphakama), idama, okanye esinye isakhiwo, cela indawo yakho ivavanywe. Umhlaba, ithambeka, ukuphuma kwamanzi, ukuhamba kwamanzi emvula enkulu, nendlela ekhuselekileyo yokuphuma kwamanzi agqithisileyo zonke ziyabalulekile. Buza umcebisi wasekuhlaleni oqeqeshiweyo.\n\nAkukho mgaqo mnye wokubeka olandelwa kuwo onke amathambeka. Khangela apho amanzi ahamba khona aze aqokelelane. Imigca yokuphakama ebekwe kakubi inokunyusa ukukhukuliseka komhlaba, kwaye umhlaba ofunxa amanzi kancinci unokubamba amanzi amaninzi kakhulu. Khetha nayiphi na imisebenzi yamanzi efanelekileyo kwindawo yakho kwaye ucwangcise indlela ekhuselekileyo yamanzi agqithisileyo.",
